  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-mU51Tfkf\" id=\"h346b9f0-mU51Tfkf\">申请授权并获取Token</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-qvFMkoRe\">操作业务接口能力前，需要开发者向业务账户持有人申请授权并获取对应AccessToken后，才可以获取到可操作账户并请求相关业务接口</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-U9XxcRTV\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/08f0c8d3627b4e81b869c0f045c2672a~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2067315113&amp;x-signature=797sZE%2FHp7w0KX2k%2FyCJvMzdjq0%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-W81eh3Ds\"><br></p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QC8sn%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Col%20start%3D%5C%221%5C%22%20data-id%3D%5C%22ob7246f7-nEMAaf98%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-1cGgPoYJ%5C%22%3E%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%95%8F%E6%84%9F%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%3Cstrong%3E%E5%A6%82%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E6%89%80%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%97%B6%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%95%8F%E6%84%9F%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C%2Fstrong%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E6%83%85%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%EF%BC%89%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-iZRaxDtr%5C%22%3E%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90Token%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93Token%E4%B8%8E%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%EF%BC%9A%E3%80%90%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F41%2Fdocs%2F1812506522148059%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96Token%E5%B9%B6%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81%E6%95%88%E6%9C%9F%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%91%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Fol%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-yYRzPBhB%5C%22%3E%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%EF%BC%9A%E3%80%90%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F41%2Fdocs%2F1812506430648330%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ol start=\"1\" data-id=\"ob7246f7-nEMAaf98\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1cGgPoYJ\">素材属于敏感物料信息，<strong>如开发者认证使用的主体信息（公司信息）与业务账号所属主体不一致，授权时同时需要申请敏感物料授权</strong>（可参考下方详情流程中的介绍）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-iZRaxDtr\">授权页面登录多个账号分别完成授权，需要分别记录对应生成Token，具体Token与授权账户关系介绍可参考：【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/41/docs/1812506522148059\" target=\"_blank\">如何获取Token并维持效期</a>】</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-yYRzPBhB\">详细申请授权流程可参考：【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/41/docs/1812506430648330\" target=\"_blank\">如何申请授权</a>】</p></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-yu6oJJlQ\"><br></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-gdUKiA7E\" id=\"h346b9f0-gdUKiA7E\">获取已授权账号下管理账户</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-FkVD4w6J\">授权完成后，即可开始进行业务接口接入调试，需要先根据接口确认已授权可操作账户范围</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Yc2dnzvD\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/c86b4bb291484520acd51bf26b19beda~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2067315214&amp;x-signature=sKFEifgYEmO0otRZskSxagyK2PY%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p0e47204-Wf1CiF1R\">在完成授权并得到Token后，可通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/37/docs/1696710506574848\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取已授权账号</a>】接口查询AccessToken下具体授权的账号信息</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fBswP%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-wqU3SAl0%5C%22%3E%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%EF%BC%9A%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%B7%2F%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B1%E5%8F%B7%E4%B8%BA%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%90%8C%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-dmqb7kXJ%5C%22%3E%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E4%B8%8B%E5%BC%80%E9%80%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%8B%E5%A6%82%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E3%80%81%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%8F%B0%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E3%80%81%E6%96%B9%E8%88%9F%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E7%AD%89%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wqU3SAl0\">账号：登录时对应手机号/邮箱号为账号，可使用同账号在不同业务平台登录查看账号在不同业务线下的管理账户</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-dmqb7kXJ\">账户：不同业务下开通的账户，例如巨量投放账户、工作台账户、方舟账户等</p></div></div></div></div>",
